page('size-guide.html','Find your fit',heading('SMALL MEASUREMENTS. A BEAUTIFUL FIT.','Made to feel <em>like you.</em>','A few minutes of measuring makes all the difference. Measure both hands before choosing your set.')+f'''<section class="wrap guide-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR MEASURING RITUAL</p><div class="numbered"><span>01</span><div><h2>Tape, mark, measure.</h2><p>Place a small piece of clear tape across the widest part of your natural nail. Mark both side edges, remove the tape and measure between the marks in millimetres with a ruler.</p></div></div><div class="numbered"><span>02</span><div><h2>Do all ten.</h2><p>Record thumb, index, middle, ring and pinky for each hand. Your hands may have different measurements.</p></div></div><div class="numbered"><span>03</span><div><h2>Match your measurements.</h2><p>Compare each nail with the chart. If your measurements do not match a complete standard size, choose Custom and enter both hands on the product page.</p></div></div></div><aside class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">AT A GLANCE</p><h2>The size chart</h2><p class="muted">All measurements are nail widths in mm.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption class="sr-only">Standard nail width measurements</caption><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Thumb</th><th>Index</th><th>Middle</th><th>Ring</th><th>Pinky</th></tr></thead><tbody>{''.join('<tr>'+''.join(f'<{("th" if j==0 else "td")}>{v}</{("th" if j==0 else "td")}>' for j,v in enumerate(row))+'</tr>' for row in size_rows)}</tbody></table></div><p>Between sizes? A slightly wider nail can be gently filed at the sides. Avoid a nail that presses into your skin.</p></aside></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S FIND YOUR MATCH</p><h2>Your size, <em>made simple.</em></h2><p>Enter the measurements for one hand. Repeat for the other; choose Custom if the results differ.</p><form id="size-form"><div class="measurement-fields">{''.join(f'<label>{n}<input name="{n.lower()}" type="number" min="5" max="25" step="0.5" placeholder="mm" required></label>' for n in ['Thumb','Index','Middle','Ring','Pinky'])}</div><button class="button" type="submit">Find my size →</button><p id="size-result" role="status"></p></form></div></section>''')

page('nail-care.html','Application & care',heading('PRESS. LOVE. REPEAT.','A little care.<br><em>A lot of beautiful moments.</em>','Your guide to applying, wearing and gently removing your press-on nails.')+'''<section class="wrap care-grid"><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">01 / PREPARE</p><h2>A clean start.</h2><p>Match each press-on to its natural nail before you begin. Wash and dry your hands, gently push back cuticles and lightly buff the nail surface.</p><p>Remove dust and oils with a nail prep wipe. Let nails dry completely.</p></article><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">02 / APPLY</p><h2>Find your fit.</h2><p>Choose adhesive tabs or nail glue intended for press-ons. Follow the adhesive manufacturer’s directions for quantity, placement and holding time.</p><p>Align near the cuticle, then press down evenly. Avoid applying adhesive to the skin.</p></article><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">03 / ENJOY</p><h2>Wear with love.</h2><p>Keep your hands dry for the time recommended by your adhesive. Wear gloves for cleaning and avoid using your nails to open or pry things.</p><p>Wear time depends on preparation, adhesive and your daily routine.</p></article><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">04 / REMOVE & STORE</p><h2>Gently does it.</h2><p>Follow your adhesive’s removal instructions. Never pull or force a nail off. Give the adhesive time to release, then gently lift when loose.</p><p>Clean away residue using a method suitable for the nail material, dry fully and store in your box. Reuse only nails that remain in good condition.</p></article></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="soft-banner"><div><h2>A beautiful fit comes first.</h2><p>Not sure which size to choose? We’ve made it simple.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="size-guide.html">Find your fit ↗</a></div></section>''')

